{"articleNo":"242416","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=242416&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [근로](선발완료) 2020-2학기 학기 중 대학근로장학생 추가 모집 안내( 발열점검소 운영 보조)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.09.15","hit":"8815","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><font size=\"5\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">- 2020-2학기 학기 중&nbsp;대학근로장학생 모집 안내 -</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><strong><u>발열점검소 운영보조 신청 안내 입니다.</u></strong></strong></span><br></p><div class=\"view_content\" id=\"view_content\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">성실하게 근무 하실분 신청해주세요.</span></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">신청기간 9월 16일 18시까지 마감</span></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><strong></strong></strong></span><br></p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"3\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>1.&nbsp;자격요건</strong></span><br></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;2020-2학기&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;중&nbsp;직전학기&nbsp;성적&nbsp;70점/100점&nbsp;만점(평점&nbsp;1.6)&nbsp;이상</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;정규학기&nbsp;내&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;(휴학생,&nbsp;초과학기자&nbsp;제외)</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;신청기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2020.9</span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">.16.(수)&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;~18:00&nbsp;까지</span></span></span></font></strong></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">3.&nbsp;근로기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020.9월 중~2020.12.20.(일)&nbsp;[학기&nbsp;중]</span><strong><strong></strong></strong></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"3\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">4. 근로지 내역 </span></strong></strong></span></span></span></strong></strong></font></p></span><p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">근로 업무 :&nbsp;테크노관, 글로벌관, 디지털관, 생활관, 식당&nbsp;발열점검소 운영 보조(출입구 안내)</span></span></span></strong></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">​&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 근로 시간 : 관별(테크노관, 글로벌관, 디지털관)16:00~18:00</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">생활관, 식당 11:30~13:30/17:00~19:00</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">5.&nbsp;신청방법</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;희망부서&nbsp;온라인&nbsp;신청&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;근로장학생&nbsp;선발&nbsp;확정&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;온라인&nbsp;신청방법:&nbsp;</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>- 학과/학번/이름/연락처 기재</strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>- 희망요일,시간 기재 </strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>ex) 월요일 16:00~18:00희망 또는 화요일 11:30~13:30희망</strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>-이메일(<a href=\"mailto:sej@kumoh.ac.kr\">sej@kumoh.ac.kr</a>) 신청</strong></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></span></span></p></span><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>6.&nbsp;선발일정</strong></span><br></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\